  "description": "Compile-time CancellationToken and async/await Roslyn analyzer for C#/.NET: catches missing cancellation propagation, ignored ASP.NET Core RequestAborted, EF Core, HttpClient, gRPC, SignalR, and MediatR cancellation, timeout CTS that drops a parent token, sync-over-async deadlocks, blocking I/O, async void, and resource-lifetime bugs across 51 diagnostics—with code fixes. Failures surface in the editor and CI, not only at runtime.",
